        main.about-page
            section.about-history-timeline(aria-label='Our History')
                .container.about-history-timeline-items
                    a.about-history-era(href='#aboutStory')
                        h2 A SECOND LIFE
                    a.about-history-era(href='#aboutValue')
                        h2 PREPARATION
                    a.about-history-era(href='#aboutKagoshima')
                        h2 KAGOSHIMA
                    a.about-history-era(href='#aboutSourcing')
                        h2 SOURCING
                    a.about-history-era(href='#aboutExport')
                        h2 EXPORT

            header.about-hero#aboutTop
                img.about-hero-image(src='assets/img/k-trucks/hero-showcase-02.jpg' alt='' aria-hidden='true' fetchpriority='high')
                .container.about-hero-content
                    .about-hero-title(data-about-reveal)
                        span.subheading About Us
                        h1 Our History
                        p.about-lead Affordable Japanese kei trucks. Professionally prepared. Ready for their next chapter.

            .container.about-content
                section.about-section.about-story#aboutStory(data-about-reveal aria-labelledby='aboutStoryTitle')
                    .about-section-copy
                        span.about-section-index 01 / OUR STORY
                        h2#aboutStoryTitle Giving Japan’s Kei Trucks a Second Life
                        p Our story begins in Kagoshima, Japan, where kei trucks have long played an essential role in agriculture, small businesses, and everyday life.
                        p Across Japan, thousands of used kei trucks are no longer in active use. Some have been retired by older owners who no longer need them, while others sit unused despite having plenty of life left in them. For many owners, selling these vehicles at a reasonable price is a practical alternative to letting them go to waste.
                        p.about-key-point We saw an opportunity to give these trucks a new purpose.
                        p Based in Kagoshima, we specialize in sourcing affordable used kei trucks directly from the Japanese market and preparing them for customers overseas. By purchasing vehicles at competitive prices and working with
                            |&nbsp;
                            strong Tomemori Motors
                            |, a specialist in vehicle inspections and professional repainting, we aim to deliver clean, well-presented kei trucks without the premium price tag often associated with imported vehicles.
                        p.about-key-point Our philosophy is straightforward: find value in Japan, invest in the right preparation, and pass those savings on to our customers.
                        p The result is an affordable way to own a distinctive Japanese kei truck, whether for agricultural work, property maintenance, commercial use, or personal projects.
                    figure.about-section-image
                        img(src='assets/img/k-trucks/hero-showcase-03.jpg' alt='Red Japanese kei truck ready for work' loading='lazy')
                        figcaption A new purpose for practical Japanese work trucks

                section.about-section.about-section--reverse#aboutValue(data-about-reveal aria-labelledby='aboutValueTitle')
                    .about-section-copy
                        span.about-section-index 02 / THE VALUE OF PREPARATION
                        h2#aboutValueTitle More Than Just Imports — Value Through Preparation
                        p At Kei-Trucks.com, we believe that buying an affordable used vehicle should not mean compromising on presentation or transparency.
                        p Our business model is built around sourcing competitively priced vehicles in Japan and improving their appearance before export. We work with Tomemori Motors to arrange vehicle inspections and professional full-body repainting, helping selected trucks achieve a clean, refreshed finish.
                        p This approach allows us to offer three key advantages:
                        h3 Competitive Pricing
                        p By sourcing vehicles directly from the Japanese market, including trucks that previous owners no longer need, we can identify attractive purchasing opportunities and offer competitive prices to our customers.
                        h3 Professional Reconditioning
                        p We work with Tomemori Motors to have our trucks inspected and professionally repainted. This helps restore their appearance and gives each selected vehicle a fresh, presentable finish.
                        h3 Transparency and Practical Value
                        p Every used truck has its own history. Age, mileage, previous use, mechanical condition, and cosmetic wear can vary from one vehicle to another. We believe customers should have access to clear vehicle information so they can make informed purchasing decisions.
                        p.about-key-point Our objective is to offer well-presented Japanese kei trucks at prices that make sense, without unnecessary markups.
                    figure.about-section-image
                        img(src='assets/img/k-trucks/menu-truck-left.png' alt='Customized Japanese kei truck in a workshop' loading='lazy')
                        figcaption Practical value begins with thoughtful preparation

                section.about-section#aboutKagoshima(data-about-reveal aria-labelledby='aboutKagoshimaTitle')
                    .about-section-copy
                        span.about-section-index 03 / KAGOSHIMA, JAPAN
                        h2#aboutKagoshimaTitle Why Kagoshima, Japan?
                        p Kagoshima provides us with access to Japan’s rural vehicle market, where kei trucks remain an important part of everyday life.
                        p Farmers, small business owners, and rural residents rely on these compact vehicles for their practicality and versatility. When their circumstances change or they no longer need a truck, well-priced used vehicles can become available in the local market.
                        p We look for opportunities to acquire these trucks, assess their suitability for resale, and prepare selected vehicles for overseas buyers.
                        p Rather than focusing exclusively on expensive or rare models, we see value in everyday Japanese work trucks. A vehicle that has reached the end of its original owner's needs may still be a useful and economical option for someone on the other side of the world.
                        p Our role is to connect that supply with international demand while making the purchasing process as straightforward as possible.
                    figure.about-section-image
                        img(src='assets/img/k-trucks/kagoshima-kei-truck.jpg' alt='A white Japanese kei truck in a rural Kagoshima setting' loading='lazy')
                        figcaption Everyday trucks, sourced in Japan

                section.about-section.about-section--reverse#aboutSourcing(data-about-reveal aria-labelledby='aboutSourcingTitle')
                    .about-section-copy
                        span.about-section-index 04 / FROM SOURCE TO PREPARATION
                        h2#aboutSourcingTitle From Local Sourcing to Professional Preparation
                        p Every vehicle we offer begins with careful sourcing in Japan.
                        p Once a suitable truck has been identified, we work with Tomemori Motors to arrange inspection and professional repainting. The goal is to present each vehicle as cleanly and accurately as possible before it is exported.
                        p.about-key-point We recognize that a fresh exterior finish is only one part of a vehicle's overall condition. Repainting does not make a used truck mechanically equivalent to a new vehicle, and we do not expect every truck to be identical. Instead, we focus on presenting each vehicle honestly and providing the information customers need to understand what they are purchasing.
                        p.about-highlight Our competitive advantage is the combination of affordable Japanese sourcing, professional cosmetic preparation, and value-focused pricing.
                        p We want our customers to see the appeal of a well-presented kei truck without paying more than necessary.
                    figure.about-section-image
                        img(src='assets/img/k-trucks/hero-showcase-01.jpg' alt='A prepared blue kei truck outside in the countryside' loading='lazy')
                        figcaption Carefully prepared, ready for its next chapter

                section.about-section#aboutExport(data-about-reveal aria-labelledby='aboutExportTitle')
                    .about-section-copy
                        span.about-section-index 05 / A CLEAR EXPORT PROCESS
                        h2#aboutExportTitle Exporting from Japan: A Clear and Straightforward Process
                        p Buying a kei truck in Japan is only the first step. Import requirements, customs clearance, taxes, and registration procedures vary depending on the destination country.
                        p Kei-Trucks.com focuses on sourcing vehicles in Japan, preparing them for export, and coordinating the applicable export-side arrangements specified in each listing or sales agreement.
                        p Our pricing reflects the vehicle and the applicable preparation and export-related costs included in the individual offer. Before completing a purchase, customers can review the relevant pricing details and confirm which services are included.
                        p.about-highlight Unless otherwise agreed in writing, the buyer is responsible for import customs clearance, destination-country documentation, applicable duties and taxes, and local registration or compliance requirements.
                        p.about-key-point For customers in the United States, import eligibility and road-use requirements may depend on federal regulations as well as state and local rules. We strongly recommend confirming the applicable requirements before purchasing a vehicle.
                        p By clearly distinguishing the Japan-side export arrangements from the buyer's import responsibilities, we aim to help customers understand the process and avoid unexpected costs.
                    figure.about-section-image
                        img(src='assets/img/k-trucks/hero-showcase-05.jpg' alt='A kei truck prepared for a long-distance journey' loading='lazy')
                        figcaption From Japan to the next destination
                
                section.about-section.about-contact(data-about-reveal)
                    p We’re here to help you find
                        |&nbsp;
                        strong the perfect truck, learn everything you need to know, and become part of a growing community that shares your passion.
                    p If you have questions, want to browse our latest imports, or just want to chat about all things Kei trucks,
                        |&nbsp;
                        strong reach out anytime.
                    p.about-key-point 📩 Contact Us:
                        |&nbsp;
                        a(href='mailto:keitrucks.fun@gmail.com') keitrucks.fun@gmail.com

